SUMMARY:KonKIS26 | #WeAreOpen
DESCRIPTION:The Conference of the AI Service Centers\nThis year’s AI Service Centers conference takes place under the banner “WE ARE OPEN”\, and we mean it. Take advantage of our AI services for your project and turn your idea into an AI application with real added value. \nWhether it’s practical presentations or in-depth workshops offering insights into the latest research\, here you’ll find inspiration\, connections\, and support. Would you like to implement AI in your company or in the public sector—in a trustworthy\, secure\, and sustainable way? As an AI transfer specialist\, are you looking for open dialogue with other initiatives and partners? Are you as enthusiastic about open applications (open source)\, open data\, and collaborative approaches as we are? Then KonKIS26 is the perfect place for you! #WeAreOpen \nWhen: November 25 and 26\, 2026\nWhere: AI Village\, An der Hasenkaule 10\, 50354 Hürth (near Cologne) \nRegistration & ticket fees: Participation is free. Sign up now to secure your spot! \nNote: The program will be conducted in German.
URL:https://www.hessian.ai/event/konkis26-weareopen/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.hessian.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/KonKIS26-wao-CB-1.png
END:VEVENT
