UID:20867-1795694400-1795697100@www.hessian.ai
SUMMARY:Who is developing AI in Hesse? Live webinar on aigude.ai
DESCRIPTION:What AI startups are there in Hesse? Who is conducting research on which topics? And where are the opportunities for collaboration? \nWith aigude.ai\, hessian.AI brings together information about the research-based AI ecosystem in one place. Originating from the AI Startup Landscape Hessen\, the platform makes it easier to find startups\, research and expertise\, and turns the previous snapshot into a continuously updated register. \nTobias Kehl\, project manager and developer of aigude as well as co-lead of AI Startup Rising\, will present the platform and the vision behind it. In a live deep dive\, he will demonstrate how policymakers\, the media\, funding agencies\, and networks can use aigude for their research and networking. Afterward\, there will be time for questions and feedback. \nThursday\, November 26\, 2026 | 12:00–12:45 p.m. | Online webinar \nTry it out now: Landscape 2026 · aigude
URL:https://www.hessian.ai/event/who-is-developing-ai-in-hesse-live-webinar-on-aigude-ai/
LOCATION:Online
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.hessian.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/aigude-webinar-26-11-eventbrite-1.png
END:VEVENT
