UID:20876-1796299200-1796301900@www.hessian.ai
SUMMARY:Your Startup on aigude.ai Greater Visibility\, New Opportunities
DESCRIPTION:Your Startup on aigude.ai Greater Visibility\, New Opportunities \nYour AI solution needs to be discovered\, by potential partners\, talent\, investors\, and the media. \naigude.ai\, the new platform from hessian.ai makes the Hessian AI ecosystem easier to explore and provides a new home for the AI Startup Landscape Hessen. In this live deep dive\, Tobias Kehl\, project manager and developer at aigude\, as well as co-lead of AI Startup Rising—will show you how to use the platform for your startup: from registering or claiming your profile\, to updating information about your solution\, to posting job openings. You’ll also learn how up-to-date profiles help you get discovered by companies looking for suitable use cases\, and what other features are in the works. \naigude is built on the “Build in public” principle: Your questions\, experiences\, and ideas are very welcome and help us continue to develop the platform. \nThursday\, December 3\, 2026 | 12:00–12:45 p.m. | Online webinar \nTake a look around first: aigude.ai
URL:https://www.hessian.ai/event/your-startup-on-aigude-ai-greater-visibility-new-opportunities/
LOCATION:Online
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.hessian.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/aigude-webinar-03-12-en-eventbrite.png
END:VEVENT
